  "notes": "The prefix {数|すう} ('several, a number of') attaches to counters to give a vague quantity.\n\nCOMMON COLLOCATIONS:\n- {数年前|すうねんまえ}: several years ago\n- この{数年|すうねん}: these past few years\n- {数年間|すうねんかん}: over a period of several years\n\nRELATED WORDS:\n- {数日|すうじつ}: several days\n- {数週間|すうしゅうかん}: several weeks\n- {数十年|すうじゅうねん}: several decades",
